4. Constraints / open questions → `04-constraints/`.
5. Architecture → `07-system-design/` (+ `docs/adr/`).
6. Verification → `08-verification/`.
7. Languages → `07-system-design/options/` and `nests/` (not tip Cargo scaffolds).
